# tfs CLI and the link-unit tarball from the tamatebako/tebako release.
# The asset digests are pinned HERE — tools.sha256 is the repo's
# toolchain pin SSOT (the workflow carries no version or digest literals;
# tools/pins.rb reads this block into $GITHUB_ENV). The tfs pins are
# cross-checked against the release's SHA256SUMS at fetch time; the
# link-unit tarballs are NOT in that monolith, so these pins are their
# single trust anchor (all pins verified against the v2.8.28 downloads
# 2026-10-12).
